# Bumble Beeline - Project Context

## Overview

This is a **mobile web prototype** for a redesigned Bumble dating app featuring "Beeline" - an AI-powered matchmaking assistant. The prototype was built from 32 Figma designs as part of the A-IXD (Advanced Interaction Design) Project 2.

## Tech Stack

- **Framework**: Next.js 16 (App Router)
- **Language**: TypeScript
- **Styling**: Tailwind CSS v4 (CSS-based config, not JS)
- **Animations**: Framer Motion
- **Gestures**: @use-gesture/react
- **Icons**: Lucide React

