## Implemented Screens (32 total states)

### Onboarding Flow

1. Splash screen with Bumble logo
2. Gender selection (Woman/Man/Nonbinary)
3. Interest selection (chip grid, 5 max)
4. Life experiences (Travel/Education/Working categories)
5. Values/qualities selection
6. Notification permission prompt

### Main App

7. Discover/People view with swipeable cards
8. Profile card with Beeline overlay (collapsed)
9. Profile card with Beeline question (expanded)
10. Profile card with Beeline voice input
11. Profile card with Beeline "Done" state
12. Swipe right animation (checkmark)
13. Swipe left animation (X)
14. "Beeline profile ready" banner

### Profile Tab

15. Kyle's profile with "Give me a second to read the room"
16. Profile tabs (Beeline, Dating advice, Photo insights)

### Match & Chat

17. "What a match!" screen with photo overlap
18. Chat list with matches row
19. Chat detail view
20. Chat with Beeline assist modal

## Key Features Implemented

- **Swipe gestures**: Framer Motion drag with threshold detection
- **Beeline AI overlay**: Multiple states (collapsed, question, voice, done)
- **Animated transitions**: Page transitions, card animations
- **Mobile viewport**: 390x844px iPhone frame for desktop viewing
- **iOS-style UI**: Status bar, bottom navigation, rounded corners

## Mock Data (src/lib/mockData.ts)

- **Profiles**: Hari (27, CMU), Elena (28, Johns Hopkins)
- **User profile**: Kyle (27, "The Domestic Daredevil")
